{
  "_comment": "Heists. Positions are world metres (x east, z south). A facade target's points come from its facade (x, z on the building wall, nx/nz pointing out to the sidewalk). roles: which of breacher / hacker / smoke / hauler a crew must or may have (up to 3 Streetmon). payoutPool: total cash, split across the loot bags when the job is planned. noise: what makes noise (per second breaching (no fading while you're at it), per case smashed, per gunshot or explosion near the job); at the security's noiseLimit the alarm goes off, and an alarm spoils alarmLootLoss of the cash (dye packs). escape.stars: the Wanted Level when the getaway starts (+1 if the alarm went off, plus heat). Deliver the loot to one of the drop-offs with no stars on you. phases.exposure: how suspicious you look to guards and cameras (just passing, hanging round the breach point, breaking in or carrying loot).",
